        "answer": "This is the cscriptbundlebase class method error(condition,str_msg), not a global error function. On false condition return false without other work. On true condition, truthy _testing takes an empty branch; otherwise synchronously call assertmsg with _s.type, opaque dev separators, hashtostring(_str_name) and str_msg concatenated. If execution reaches the next statement, launch a new on_error thread on the implicit object context, then return true. Do not assume assertmsg returns: native assertion behavior may prevent the later launch/return. The on_error call can involve class dispatch/overrides; the declaration candidates are recorded separately without claiming the actual dynamic implementation. No error state is assigned by this body itself.",
